theoretical_claims.value:
Yes. I check the proofs in the Appendix. especially for Theorem 4.1 and Theorem 5.3, since these theorems are the key contributions of this paper. 

- Theorem 4.1 derives the distribution of conditional TPR on calibrated set, the distribution parameters are determined by the significance level and size of the calibrated set;

- Theorem 5.3 provides a concrete method for integrating multiple p-values, which is the basis of the proposed eg-BH algorithm.

